(7750010, 1279101, 104230, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, lovely shapes and tones, as well as fitting the challenge topic so well.  It has the feel of a woodcut print.<br/> <br/>It may not be taken in England (but maybe Ireland since I recall similar views over the years taken by Paul <img border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/100393.gif" xalt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/100393.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/100393.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=100393" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">paul</a>!) but this feels like a lane in Somerset near where my brother lives. A rare 10 from me.</td>', 'Wonderful, lovely shapes and tones, as well as fitting the challenge topic so well.  It has the feel of a woodcut print. It may not be taken in England (but maybe Ireland since I recall similar views over the years taken by Paul  paul!) but this feels like a lane in Somerset near where my brother lives. A rare 10 from me.', '2023-06-14 13:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
