(7750189, 1280234, 75585, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 2nd place finish - I love the coloring, composition  just everything! Sorry you received such a low ball vote without comment as I don''t see anything about this image that would deserve that.  Looks like a few top finishes received them too, not all, but too many.  Which on the upside evens out the ''hit'' so to speak.  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2023-06-16 14:24:06.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on your 2nd place finish - I love the coloring, composition  just everything! Sorry you received such a low ball vote without comment as I don''t see anything about this image that would deserve that.  Looks like a few top finishes received them too, not all, but too many.  Which on the upside evens out the ''hit'' so to speak.  ', '2023-06-16 01:19:44.000000', '2023-06-16 15:24:06.000000', 0),
